This is an alternate version of Paranoid....
 
                       PARANOID - BLACK SABBATH
 
 The following chords are the only ones used in this song (G2 means
 only an alternative formation for G, it's not Gsus2 or something).
 
 E     D     G     C     G2
 -------------------------------
 ------------------------12-----
 ------------12----10----12-----
 14----12----12----10----12-----
 14----12----10----8------------
 12----10-----------------------
 
 Here are the rhythm figures used in the song (2'-' = 8th note)
 
 FIGURE 1A
 
 E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|D-D-D-D-D-D-D-D-|G-D-----E---G2--|
 
 FIGURE 1B
 
 E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|D-D-D-D-D-D-D-D-|G-D-----E-------|
 
