 E---------------|C-------D-------|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|
 
 FIGURE 3
 
 E---------------|----------------|D---------------|----------------|
 
 INTRO (4'-' = 8th note)
 --------------------------------|--------------------------------|
 --------------------------------|--------------------------------|
 --------------------------------|--------------------------------|
 --------------------------------|--------12-h14----------12------|
 (12)h14-----(12)h14-----(12)h14-|12-h14----------12-h14------14--|
 12----------12----------12------|--------------------------------|
 
 KEY:
 h = hammer on
 (12) = this note hardly takes time to sound
 
 Finally, song flow and lyrics (Figure 1 = Figure 1A + Figure 1B)
 
 [INTRO] X4
 w/Figure 1
 Finished with my woman cause she couldn't help me with my mind
 People think I'm insane because I am frowning all the time
